flowchart TD
    A[Input bytes] --> B[BitIterator read bit by bit]
    B --> C[Accumulate current code and len]
    C --> D{Code exists in table}
    D -->|Yes symbol| E[Emit symbol byte]
    D -->|EOS symbol| F[Error EosInString]
    D -->|No| G[Read next bit]
    E --> G
    G --> H{End of input}
    H -->|Yes| I[Validate EOS style padding]
    I -->|valid| J[Decoded output]
    I -->|invalid| K[InvalidPadding]
